      <title>Bitcoin ETFs Swing Positive as Token Holds Jump Above $81,000</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-21/bitcoin-etfs-swing-positive-as-token-holds-jump-above-81-000</link>
